    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "It shouldn't bait us because we have a clear contrast and a choice to make between the prosecutor and the felon. You've heard that over and over again. It's clear. He does not want to talk about his faults, his errors. He does not want to talk about his focus on doubling down on trickle down economics instead of making our system fairer and ensuring that everybody can thrive in our economy. And he certainly doesn't want to talk about issues of freedom. freedoms that he wishes to obstruct just like the actions on January 6th. So let's be very clear here. The only risk that Democrats have here is that we are focused on something slightly different, but we have to return to what Americans are voting on. They're voting on their economic livelihoods. They're voting on their future and their freedoms. That's what we're going to focus on. That's what I'm talking about on the campaign trail, and I know the vice president will be doing the same.",
