        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Identity is inherently part of who the addressee is.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "During the campaign, the addressee often repeated the phrase 'I'm not running to make history. I'm running to make a difference.'",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
