        "text": "Public figures should have agency over how their identity is discussed in politics.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Being recognized as historic by others does not necessarily align with personal intentions.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "There is tension between individual self-perception and societal perception of identity in political representation.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the addressee’s experience offers insight into navigating racial identity in high-profile political roles.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Political candidates should prioritize policy impact over symbolic representation.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
